# StatusMenusFeed: steps from parity/shell_modules_menubar_StatusMenusFeed.qml.md (batches 1-5). Screen TESSERA-TEST 1920x1080 scale 1;
# the island is centred at x 960 (closed y ~14, open ~392 wide); the bar is 30 px tall.
# Each block runs in both looks: the file runs top to bottom, Material first, then Glass.

look material
rec battery-open 1 ipc panels open batteryMenu TESSERA-TEST
note the health line is filled from the first frame (no empty then filled)
ipc panels close
rec resources-open 1 ipc panels open resourcesMenu TESSERA-TEST
note figures present at once
ipc panels close

look glass
rec battery-open 1 ipc panels open batteryMenu TESSERA-TEST
note the health line is filled from the first frame (no empty then filled)
ipc panels close
rec resources-open 1 ipc panels open resourcesMenu TESSERA-TEST
note figures present at once
ipc panels close
